0 WeDo 2.0 rover (Brickwright Robot Lab reference model)
0 Name: wedo-milo.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // A Milo-style WeDo 2.0 rover: the Smart Hub on top, the WeDo motor on port A hanging
0 // under it on a stack of bricks and driving one wheel at the back, two ball castors on
0 // Technic bricks at the front, and the motion sensor on port B looking ahead. Its program
0 // drives until the sensor sees the wall.
